---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Project from "../components/ProjectPage";
import TerminalCTA from "../components/TerminalCTA";
---

<Layout title="Projects | Sujal Jariwala" description="Selected projects by Sujal Jariwala demonstrating frontend and full-stack development skills using modern web technologies.">
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col">
      <!-- Header / Status bar -->
      <div class="border-b border-zinc-100 pb-6 mb-10 select-none">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2"
        >
          <div class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-400 truncate">
            root@sujal:~# cd /projects && ls -la
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 shrink-0">
            Total: 3 objects found
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Status pill — wraps gracefully on very small screens -->
        <div
          class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 p-3 rounded-lg w-full max-w-xl"
        >
          <span
            class="text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[10px] bg-zinc-200/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded"
            >status</span
          >
          <span class="text-zinc-400">sys_load:</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-800 font-medium">nominal</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-300 hidden sm:inline">|</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-400">telemetry:</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-emerald-600">
            <span
              class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-pulse"
            ></span>
            open_to_new_roles
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats grid: 1 col on xs, 2 on sm, 4 on md -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12 sm:mb-16 select-none"
      >
        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-150 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col justify-between font-mono"
        >
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-400">sys_param::react_bundle</div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
              &lt; 500 KB
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-pulse"
              ></span>
              optimized from 1.5mb
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-150 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col justify-between font-mono"
        >
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-400">sys_param::lighthouse_score</div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
              90+
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-pulse"
              ></span>
              improved from 71
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-150 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col justify-between font-mono"
        >
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-400">sys_param::state_cache</div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
              Redis
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-pulse"
              ></span>
              queues & caching active
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-150 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col justify-between font-mono"
        >
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-400">sys_param::api_gateway</div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
              Go / REST
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-pulse"
              ></span>
              concurrent backend
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Projects list (component handles its own layout) -->
      <Project client:load />

      <!-- Engineering Creed -->
      <div class="mt-20 sm:mt-28 pt-10 sm:pt-14 border-t border-zinc-100">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-3 select-none">
          // cat ~/_protocols/how_i_think.md
        </div>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-8 sm:mb-10"
        >
          How I Think / Engineering Creed
        </h2>

        <!-- Creed grid: 1 col on mobile, 2 on sm, 3 on md -->
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6"
        >
          <div
            class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col"
          >
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-4 select-none">
              [0x01_abstractions]
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
              Earned Abstractions
            </h4>
            <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              I completely resist surface-level abstractions. Layers of complex
              boilerplate are deep technical debt unless they prove absolute
              necessity. I build with raw software quality and bare-metal
              performance at the forefront, writing code that behaves
              predictably under load.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col"
          >
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-4 select-none">
              [0x02_depth]
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
              Depth over Surface
            </h4>
            <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              I don't patch symptoms; I master domain realities. Developing an
              intuitive, ground-up understanding of system capabilities is
              exactly what drove the architectural approach for
              Resuvo—orchestrating an isolated hybrid engine that splits
              lightweight static Astro spaces from interactive React states.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/20 flex flex-col
                   sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-1"
          >
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-4 select-none">
              [0x03_agnosticism]
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
              User Experience & Stack Fluidity
            </h4>
            <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Users are the ultimate system validators, and their runtime
              latency dictates the stack. I never anchor myself to a single
              modern framework ecosystem. I analyze the problem first, adapting
              dynamically to whatever environment eliminates overhead and
              minimizes final client load.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <TerminalCTA client:visible />
  </section>
</Layout>
